{"v":2,"catch":"我要奪走你心中的「閃亮」。","desc":"魔法少女菈碧絲，是名門艾德克雷茲家族的么女。\n\n她的父母和四名兄長都是擁有強大魔力的精英。\n但是，菈碧絲所擁有的魔力卻連平庸都稱不上，\n每天在魔法學校中被人嘲笑是「艾德克雷茲家族的包袱」。\n\n這樣的她為了升學，決定挑戰某項測試——\n那就是收集由人類心中強烈「情感」所產生的「璀璨結晶」。\n然而，當她鼓起勇氣前往人間之後，卻碰上了一群個性古怪的男孩們……","publisher":"Game Source Entertainment","release":"2024-04-25","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 6.8GB / Switch 6.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a35cf206f9557f9635b39d5354f9fb82d23f68345eb58aeca63972dfec982fd1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dfca217fdf8b3a3fda4d8a7fa7601ef49a46af2bc6b3d3ceef8486619fec7169.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06bbad8c0755aed700ed6e73cd76b27b3ecaf0404ed40289f6eae18b58fe085a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd604c7a6525cc293c46b86f11d4341025f4bca7c69fdf28e48fdfb1f24f5015.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f60d163deea0fdf4d30553a6e4fb3ab2c2f66fca22d276a2acce359c0525aad2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a4face19644dade4a63ce7a0de85bae365cac7709a9a6a6907e06773861c7d83.jpg"],"titleId":"01002e201d8b8000"}